<title>USA: Gabelli group raises Syratech stake.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group raises Syratech stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Thursday it raised its stake in Syratech Corp. to 1,510,000 common shares, or 17.4 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 172,000 Syratech common shares between March 11 and 25 at prices ranging from $31.625 to $32.010 a share.</p>
</text>
